{"title":"Career Roadmap: Computer Science & Engineering (Networks) → Cloud Network Architect","role":"Cloud Network Architect","summary":"A Cloud Network Architect designs and governs network infrastructure across cloud and hybrid environments.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Computer Science & Engineering (Networks)"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Domain","text":"Cloud Networking, Network Architecture & Infrastructure"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cloud Network Architect designs and governs network infrastructure across cloud and hybrid environments."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines traditional networking with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud architecture"},{"text":"Network security"},{"text":"Virtual networking"},{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Connectivity"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"High availability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A CSE Networks graduate has a strong foundation for this career because the specialization already emphasizes computer networks and network infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design cloud network architectures"},{"text":"Plan VPC/VNet environments"},{"text":"Design IP addressing and subnetting"},{"text":"Configure routing"},{"text":"Design hybrid cloud connectivity"},{"text":"Implement load balancing"},{"text":"Design DNS architecture"},{"text":"Build secure network segmentation"},{"text":"Design VPN and private connectivity"},{"text":"Integrate on-premises and cloud networks"},{"text":"Design highly available network systems"},{"text":"Implement network monitoring"},{"text":"Automate infrastructure"},{"text":"Review security and compliance requirements"},{"text":"Document network architectures"},{"text":"Support disaster recovery and business continui