 / Azure / GCP","VPC/VNet + DNS + VPN","Cloud Networking","Terraform + Python","Hybrid Cloud + High Availability","Network / Cloud Internship","Network Engineer / Cloud Engineer","Cloud Network Engineer","Senior Cloud Network Engineer","Cloud Network Architect","Principal / Enterprise Architect"]},{"type":"note","label":"Core priority","text":"The student should first become an excellent network engineer, then a strong cloud network engineer, and only then move toward architecture. The most important combination is TCP/IP + routing + Linux + cloud networking + security + Terraform + automation + architecture, rather than focusing on cloud certifications alone."}]}]}